    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the hypochondriac region, vomiting, acid regurgitation, hiccup, jaundice, mastitis." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the anterior thoracic region, in the sev- enth intercostal space, 4 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note 1: GB 24 is inferior to the centre of the nipple, one rib inferior to LR 14. Note 2: In females, GB24 can be found at the intersection of the midclavicular line and the seventh intercostal space." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasSpecificReferenceLocation UBERON:0002030,
