    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "headache, nasal obstruction, epistaxis, blurred and failing vision." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the head, 0.5 B-cun superior to the anterior hairline, 1.5 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: At the junction of the medial one third and lateral two thirds of the line connecting gV24 with St8." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
