<http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_0913913> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "LU 1" ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "[Acupoint Location, Pinyin Label, Chinese Label] WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization (WHO), WHO Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 26. https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/353407",
        "[Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, Indications] Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Edited by C. Xinnong, Rev. Ed., Foreign Languages Press, Beijing, China, 1999. Ch. 7, Acupuncture Points of the Taiyin and Yangming Meridians. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7." ;
    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "中府" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0016416 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The intermediate supraclavicular nerve, the branches of the anterior thoracic nerve, and the lateral cutaneous branch of the first intercostal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "cough, asthma, pain in the chest, shoulder and back, fullness in the chest." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the anterior thoracic region, at the same level as the first intercostal space, lateral to the infraclavicular fossa, 6 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line.
Note 1: After locating LU2, LU1 is located 1 B-cun inferior to LU2.
Note 2: ST14, KI26, CV20 and LU1 are located on the transverse line along the first intercostal space.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.5-0.8 cun towards the lateral aspect of the chest. To avoid injuring the lung, never puncture deeply towards the medial aspect. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Zhongfu" ;
    tara-ap:hasRelatedArtery UBERON:0001394,
        UBERON:0001395 ;
    tara-ap:hasRelatedNerve ILX:0792193,
        ILX:0794975,
        ILX:0797476 ;
    tara-ap:hasRelatedVein UBERON:0000985,
        UBERON:8600074 ;
    tara-ap:hasSpecialPointRole <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_5996486> ;
    tara-ap:hasSpecificReferenceLocation ILX:0795283,
        ILX:0795284,
        ILX:0795285 ;
    tara-ap:hasSynonym "Front-Mu Point of the Lung",
        "L 1",
        "Lung 1" ;
    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "Superolaterally, the axillary artery and vein, the thoracoacromial artery and vein." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_9964503> ;
