        "Bladder 42",
        "UB 42",
        "Urinary Bladder 42" ;
    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "The posterior branch of the intercostal artery, the descending branch of the transverse cervical artery." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_7525476> ;
