    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The anastomotic branch of the lateral branch of the frontal nerve and the great occipital nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "headache, blurred vision, nasal obstruction." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the head, 2.5 B-cun superior to the anterior hairline, 1.5 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: 1.5 B-cun superior to BL5. 2 B-cun superior to BL4" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Chengguang" ;
