    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "The anastomotic network of the frontal artery and vein, the superficial temporal artery and vein, the occipital artery and vein." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_7525476> ;
