    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "epilepsy, mania, headache, dizziness, insomnia, backache, aching of the leg." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the lateral aspect of the foot, directly inferior to the prominence of the lateral malleolus, in the depression between the inferior border of the lateral malleolus and the calcaneus. Note: BL62 is located in the depression distal to the inferior border of the lateral malleolus. the corresponding medial acupuncture point to BL 62 is KI6." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
