    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posterior aspect of the forearm, midpoint of the interosseous space between the radius and the ulna, 4 B-cun proximal to the dorsal wrist crease. Note: At the junction of the upper two thirds and lower one third of the line connecting tE4 with the tip of the elbow." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.0 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
