    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "deafness, tinnitus, otorrhea, motor impairment of the mandibular joint, toothache." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the face, in the depression between the anterior border of the centre of the tragus and the posterior border of the condylar process of the mandible. Note: When the mouth is slightly opened, SI19 is located in the depression anterior to the centre of the tragus, between tE21 and gB2." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.0 inch when the mouth is open. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
