    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0003631 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The dorsal digital nerve derived from the deep peroneal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "hernia, enuresis, uterine bleeding, prolapse of the uterus, epilepsy." ;
