    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0005473 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "At the site where the posterior ramus of the first sacral nerve passes." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "low back pain, dysuria, constipation, irregular menstruation, morbid leukorrhea, prolapse of the uterus." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the sacral region, in the first posterior sacral foramen. Note: The first posterior sacral foramen is palpated in the depression, moving superiorly from BL32." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Shangliao" ;
