    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0005473 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The branch of the coccygeal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "irregular menstruation, pain and stiffness of the lower back, hemorrhoids, muscular atrophy of the lower extremities, epilepsy." ;
