    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "cough, asthma, furuncle, back pain, neck rigidity." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the upper back region, in the depression inferior to the spinous process of the sixth thoracic vertebra (T6), on the posterior median line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely upward 0.5-1.0 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
