        "TW 15",
        "Triple Burner 15",
        "Triple Energizer 15",
        "Triple Heater 15",
        "Triple Warmer 15" ;
    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "The descending branch of the transverse cervical artery; deeper, the muscular branch of the suprascapular artery." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_3898257> ;
