    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The superficial peroneal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the knee, muscular atrophy, motor impairment and pain of the lower extremities, blurred vision, ophthalmalgia, night blindness, distending pain of the breast." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the fibular aspect of the leg, anterior to the fibula, 5 B-cun proximal to the prominence of the lateral malleolus." ;
