    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The lateral antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the superficial branch of the radial nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "cough, asthma, fever, pain in the chest, sore throat, pain in the wrist." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the anterolateral aspect of the forearm, between the radial styloid process and the radial artery, 1 B-cun superior to the palmar wrist crease. Note: 1 B-cun superior to LU9." ;
