    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "迎(迎)香" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0001456 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The anastomotic branch of the facial nerve and infraorbital nerves." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "nasal obstruction, hyposmia, epistaxis, rhinorrhea, deviation of the mouth, itching and swelling of the face." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the face, in the nasolabial sulcus, at the same level as the midpoint of lateral border of the ala of the nose. Remarks: Alternative location for LI20 - On the face, in the nasolabial sulcus, at the level of the inferior border of the ala of the nose." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely or subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch." ;
