    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the upper back region, at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous pro- cess of the tenth thoracic vertebra (T10), 3 B-cun lateral to the posterior median line. Note: BL48, BL19 and GV7 are located at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous process of the tenth thoracic vertebra (T10)." ;
