    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posterior aspect of the arm, on the line connecting the prominence of the olecranon with the acromial angle, 5 B-cun proximal to the prominence of the olecranon." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.7 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Xiaoluo" ;
