    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "leukorrhea, lower abdominal pain, lumbar pain, hernia, constipation." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the lower abdomen, 3 B-cun inferior to the centre of umbilicus, medial to the anterior superior iliac spine. Note: GB 27 is 3 B-cun inferior to GB 26, at the same level as CV 4." ;
