<http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_9378285> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "GB 30" ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "[Acupoint Location, Pinyin Label, Chinese Label] WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization (WHO), WHO Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 186. https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/353407",
        "[Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, Indications] Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Edited by C. Xinnong, Rev. Ed., Foreign Languages Press, Beijing, China, 1999. Ch. 9, Acupuncture Points of the Jueyin and Shaoyang Meridians. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7." ;
    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "環(环)跳" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0013691 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The inferior gluteal cutaneous nerve, the inferior gluteal nerve; deeper, the sciatic nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain of the lumbar region and thigh, muscular atrophy of the lower limbs, hemiplegia." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the buttock region, at the junction of the lateral one third and medial two thirds of the line connecting the prominence of the greater trochanter with the sacral hiatus. Note: GB30 is easier to locate when the subject is lying on the side with the thigh flexed. Remarks: Alternative location for GB30 - in the buttock region, at the junction of the lateral one third and medial two thirds of the distance between the prominence of the greater trochanter and the anterior superior iliac spine." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 1.5-2.5 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Huantiao" ;
    tara-ap:hasSpecificReferenceLocation UBERON:0002503,
        UBERON:0013708,
        ILX:0741717 ;
    tara-ap:hasSynonym "G 30",
        "Gallbladder 30" ;
    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "Medially, the inferior gluteal artery and vein." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_5283975> ;
