    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "承扶" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0013691 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The posterior femoral cutaneous nerve; deeper, the sciatic nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the lower back and gluteal region, constipation, muscular atrophy, pain, numbness and motor impairment of the lower extremities." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the buttock region, at the midpoint of the gluteal fold." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 1.0-1.5 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
